fforts around personnel actions and expense management by installing daily and weekly standard work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/14/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"NVST 2020 Q2","e":"nvst","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amir Aghdaei","x":"We exceeded our temporary cost reduction target and reduced operating expenses, excluding restructuring and other exceptional charges, by approximately $110 million or 35% year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"NVST 2020 Q2","e":"nvst","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amir Aghdaei","x":"Today, we have completed planned headcount reduction actions, which will secure more than $70 million of the targeted savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"NVST 2020 Q3","e":"nvst","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Bedford","x":"We managed expenses and executed well against our $100 million permanent cost reduction program, which is a testament to the disciplined approach the Envista business system brings to planning and deployment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"NVST 2020 Q3","e":"nvst","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Bedford","x":"We continue to make progress on our permanent cost savings initiatives, realizing more than $15 million savings during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"NVST 2020 Q4","e":"nvst","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Howard Yu","x":"Adjusted operating profit margin was 19.3%, an increase of 360 basis points, largely driven by our structural cost reduction actions, which led to savings of more than $25 million in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"NVST 2020 Q4","e":"nvst","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Howard Yu","x":"Specialty Products & Technologies adjusted operating profit margin increased 60 basis points to 20.9%, due primarily to cost savings from our structural program, which were partially offset by increased investment in clear aligners and implants.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"NVST 2021 Q1","e":"nvst","d":"2021-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Jon Block","x":"…we've seen this Clear Aligner market move toward, call it faster growth, lower acuity cases via direct to consumer or maybe more like an Express lab case, Amir, if you can share with us Investors thoughts on this part of the market and how to play a bigger role there and then I've just got a…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"NVST 2021 Q1","e":"nvst","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amir Aghdaei","x":"Our continuous improvement mindset and process improvement tools have been instrumental in helping us right size the business, improve our financial structure, and achieve a stronger result in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"NVST 2021 Q1","e":"nvst","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Howard Yu","x":"4%, a 160 basis point improvement largely driven by higher gross margins, structural cost savings, and temporarily reduced spending.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/envista-holdings-corporation-nvst-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"NVST 2021 Q2"