,"x":"Just how are you thinking about next round of potential price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/envista-nvst-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q1","e":"nvst","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric Hammes","x":"…leaving capacity to invest in organic growth and M&A. As Paul mentioned previously, we are reaffirming our 2026 guidance range of 2% to 4% core growth, 7% to 13% adjusted EBITDA growth, EPS of $1.35 to $1.45 and approximately 100% free cash flow conversion. With that, I'll turn the call…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/envista-nvst-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q1","e":"nvst","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Elizabeth Anderson","x":"But can you just talk about, is it really those sort of macro drivers that are causing you guys to not raise the guidance at this point for the outperformance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/envista-nvst-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q2","e":"nvst","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Keel","x":"Core growth in Specialty Products & Technologies was up over 3%, with Spark again growing double digits but brackets and wires down high single digits, impacted by a strong prior year comp that benefited from customers buying ahead of announced tariff and price activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/envista-nvst-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q2","e":"nvst","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eric Hammes","x":"This increase was driven by improved profitability as well as the $13 million recovery related to IEEPA tariffs paid in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/envista-nvst-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q2","e":"nvst","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric Hammes","x":"I think it is important to understand that outside of China, however, we've got price growth which is coming on the back of price increases that we implemented last year and then targeted price increases by portfolio and geography this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/envista-nvst-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q2","e":"nvst","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Keel","x":"Eric, do you have a view on whether the 10% price increase will be net beneficial?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/envista-nvst-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q2","e":"nvst","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Keel","x":"We've had, I don't know, how many consistent quarters of year-over-year unit cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/envista-nvst-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q2","e":"nvst","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Keel","x":"And rounding out Slide 4, based on our strong first half performance and continued momentum, we're raising our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/envista-nvst-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q2","e":"nvst","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Keel","x":"Behind strong first half performance and continued momentum, we're raising our full year outlook for core sales growth, adjusted EBITDA and adjusted EPS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/envista-nvst-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q3","e":"nvst","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eric Hammes","x":"Q3 free cash flow was $63 million, including roughly $16 million in tariff refunds offset by $14 million of net CapEx.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/envista-nvst-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q3","e":"nvst","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eric Hammes","x":"We have now received refunds for essentially all IEEPA tariffs paid in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/envista-nvst-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q3","e":"nvst","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Keel","x":"Across 2025, pretty much every dental participant raised price, starting with the providers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/envista-nvst-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q3","e":"nvst","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Keel","x":"And so the stable sort of model is that the manufacturers raised price at maybe half the rate of what procedure prices go up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/envista-nvst-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVST 2026 Q3","e":"nvst","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Keel","x":"And then the third, in this particular case, the government isn't reducing the procedure price, but they are breaking the materials cost and the procedure cost out on the patient invoice.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/envista-nvst-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[40,1,8343,0,0,0,6890,1115],[41,1,8058,0,0,0,6913,851],[42,1,8061,0,0,0,7068,686],[43,1,8449,0,0,0,6886,1189],[44,1,8124,0,0,0,6830,1000],[45,1,7303,0,0,0,6086,945],[46,1,6971,0,0,0,5665,1001],[47,1,8852,0,0,0,7359,1144],[65,1,9645,0,0,0,3889,5138],[66,1,9134,0,0,0,7227,1573],[67,1,8269,0,0,0,6610,1331]],"cinema":[[40,1,8343,0,0,0,6890,1115],[41,1,8058,0,0,0,6913,851],[42,1,8061,0,0,0,7068,686],[43,1,8449,0,0,0,6886,1189],[44,1,8124,0,0,0,6830,1000],[45,1,7303,0,0,0,6086,945],[46,1,6971,0,0,0,5665,1001],[47,1,8852,0,0,0,7359,1144],[65,1,9645,0,0,0,3889,5138],[66,1,9134,0,0,0,72